    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="71a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 71a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Eorles Eorles swa ðærto byrie, þæt syndon eahta hors, IIII gesadelode ⁊ IIII unsadolede, ⁊ IIII helmas ⁊ IIII byrnan ⁊ VIII spera ⁊ swa fela scylda ⁊ IIII swyrd ⁊ twa hund mancus goldes.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">An earl's heriot. The heriot of an earl, as is fitting, shall be eight horses, four saddled and four unsaddled, and four helmets and four byrnies and eight spears and as many shields and four swords and 200 mancuses of gold.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Eorles swa ðærto gebyrige, þæt syndon VIII hors, IIII gesadelode ⁊ IIII unsadelode, ⁊ IIII helmas ⁊ IIII byrnan ⁊ VIII spera ⁊ eallswa fela scylda ⁊ IIII swurd ⁊ twa hund mances goldes.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
